  <data name="UsageGuideText" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Keybinds:

Twist / Twist2c
Grip a facet, then press the twist key.

Twist3c
Grip a facet, then choose from/to axes.

Macro
Press a macro hotkey by list index.
Hold MacroReverse to play backwards.

Layer masks
Binary bitmask, one bit per layer.

Structured Macros:

Record
Structured Macros &gt; Start/Stop Recording.
F1 starts a wrapper. F2 splits parts.
F3 creates a conjugate. F4 creates a commutator.

Manage
Apply, reverse, rename, delete, override masks, build RKT macros.
Files match the current puzzle size/dimension.

RKT Macro Builder:

Tick RKT twists in Manage.
Choose Target/Adjust cells.
Preview the AST, then Build RKT Macro.

Highlighting:

Enable Highlighting to use filters.

Show Cubies
Filter by colored-sticker count.

Orbit Filters
Checked: show this orbit.
Unchecked: hide this orbit.
Gray: neutral.

Color Filters
Black: require this color.
Unchecked: hide this color.
Gray: neutral.

Highlighting checked: highlight matching cubies.
Highlighting gray: highlight matching stickers.</value>
